      "items": [
        {
          "n": "115",
          "text": "Isn't it out of the question? Isn't it impossible?"
        },
        {
          "n": "116",
          "text": "Doesn't it have its limit?"
        },
        {
          "n": "117",
          "text": "Didn't(Hasn't) it become the symbol of the engagement policy?"
        },
        {
          "n": "118",
          "text": "This is not a fundamental solution. is this?"
        },
        {
          "n": "119",
          "text": "The captain gets on the plane, doesn't he?"
        },
        {
          "n": "120",
          "text": "Didn't he turn the mike off?"
        },
        {
          "n": "121",
          "text": "How did it go(proceed)?"
        },
        {
          "n": "122",
          "text": "She's not boring, is she?"
        },
        {
          "n": "123",
          "text": "I didn't ruin the plan, did I?"
        },
        {
          "n": "124",
          "text": "The project continued, didn't it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "125",
          "text": "The project did not continue, did it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "126",
          "text": "We totally(completely) ignored market principles, didn't we?"
        },
        {
          "n": "127",
          "text": "Didn't I share that(it) with you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "128",
          "text": "The loud noise woke the dog up, didn't it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "129",
          "text": "Did she know all my little shortcomings?"
        },
        {
          "n": "130",
          "text": "Which did you choose?"
        },
        {
          "n": "131",
          "text": "When did you let her in to your strange little world?"
        },
        {
          "n": "132",
          "text": "Are you perfect for each other?"
        },
        {
          "n": "133",
          "text": "Is that(it) a deal?"
        }
      ]
